  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"padding-left:160px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_456d9e8d-94d2-47b8-9519-a58c976919d7.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"457\" height=\"185\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NuvfZGd4ES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1288932368073101412?label=加入我們的 Discord！&logo=discord&link=https://discord.gg/NuvfZGd4ES\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/game-versions/950292\" alt=\"CurseForge 遊戲版本\"></p>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_e3767585-0f9d-45e9-ade4-14e04d49f1ad.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<h4 style=\"padding-left:40px\">歡迎來到 <strong>Fargo's Talismans</strong>！</h4>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">靈感源自《泰拉瑞亞》模組《Fargo's Souls Mod》，<strong>Fargo's Talismans</strong> 的核心概念與其附魔系統相似。&nbsp;遊戲中存在可合成「力量」的護符，而這些力量又能進一步融合成「我的世界之魂」。&nbsp;若你能夠製作全部四種靈魂（目前版本），即可打造最終道具——「維度之魂」！</p>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_6c1bc0c8-2ed2-4fdd-87e7-ad4dc6c5d3e9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></h4>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:left;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#e0e0e0;background-color:#0d0d0d\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#fff\">\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;width:11.5924%\">&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;width:21.1591%;text-align:center\">護符</th>\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;width:67.2485%;text-align:center\">能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_2199b212-0342-446b-a206-c8030ad2c955.png\" alt=\"空氣護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">空氣護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">抵消摔落傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_e8d02a92-e8c6-4372-b494-7290adcdec35.png\" alt=\"紫水晶護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">紫水晶護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">抵消飛射物傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_83bf5f9d-bd27-4bae-8f15-262a552ca0aa.png\" alt=\"蘋果護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">蘋果護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">提升治療效果 25%。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_f72dc147-3c9b-46ad-8042-a7b05d3e89ec.png\" alt=\"建築師護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">建築師護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">增加方塊放置距離。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_a82736d7-389d-4025-9d5b-ee96c21e7f83.png\" alt=\"極地護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">極地護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">抵消寒冷傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_40c226e5-87b6-4e0b-a98c-dfd41e013169.png\" alt=\"戰鬥護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">戰鬥護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">受傷後獲得短暫無敵。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_acaefe92-3f2f-456c-9515-a06e49d7c542.png\" alt=\"烈焰護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">烈焰護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">點燃附近怪物。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_4a0b2f96-e512-46da-9479-73fdd6c75b88.png\" alt=\"失明護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">失明護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">失明時傷害增加 25%。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_23ac1d4b-b777-4784-84f9-2b50615d04ef.png\" alt=\"仙人掌護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">仙人掌護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">反彈部分傷害給攻擊者。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_5567aef7-fca8-4cff-b4ac-ab448c54a92b.png\" alt=\"銅護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">銅護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">快速吸附地上的物品。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_6f1c201a-8247-4305-a1ac-f16910c93bbc.png\" alt=\"苦力怕護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">苦力怕護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">跳躍時爆炸。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_7373dff4-f4f2-4b60-8b7d-e75705a23b2a.png\" alt=\"白天護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">白天護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">白天傷害增加 5%。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_64ebe45c-24b8-4e7c-90f2-caa449c63478.png\" alt=\"鑽石護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">鑽石護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">抵消 20% 的傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_f9232351-8764-4394-aa81-7bf6728c22ba.png\" alt=\"龍護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">龍護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">抵消魔法傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_b4ec019e-af5a-450c-9a30-bf914af1b75f.png\" alt=\"大地護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">大地護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">空手將泥土轉為草方塊。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_33f06b86-d861-4719-9f86-642fc3ac81c3.png\" alt=\"綠寶石護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">綠寶石護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">對掠奪者與災厄村民造成額外傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_73919005-6db6-4457-a385-c2cef0ae3740.png\" alt=\"終界使者護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">終界使者護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">防止終界使者襲擊。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_4586b81b-a0eb-47d8-907f-ff52fa3a8971.png\" alt=\"附魔護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">附魔護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">移除主手或副手持有時所附帶的詛咒。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262