e=\"width:21.1591%\">螢石護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">照亮玩家視野外的怪物。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_c2825779-8243-401f-887b-c57fb910ee7d.png\" alt=\"金護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">金護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">豬靈不會攻擊你。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_88d17931-bc9e-4934-81c2-9336620ebbad.png\" alt=\"鐵魔像護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">鐵魔像護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">增加玩家最大生命值。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_0a312760-7b29-4e9a-bbab-f548d3f9469f.png\" alt=\"鐵護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">鐵護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">抵消 5% 的傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_972f6f1f-2979-42d8-9fe5-e879f4c29064.png\" alt=\"青金石護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">青金石護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">吸引經驗球至玩家身邊。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_6aa43349-4ad1-4b4b-b962-c53fdead567d.png\" alt=\"圖書館員護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1591%\">圖書館員護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2485%\">增加 50% 的經驗獲取量。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/descripti