9%\">結合部分傷害主題護符的能力。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_7cb8254f-681a-4900-9ed9-30a7240b0595.png\" alt=\"探索者之力\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1397%\">探索者之力</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2679%\">結合部分探索主題護符的能力。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_fb0725f6-1186-44d5-bb8e-c13cd6a2ab86.png\" alt=\"負面之力\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1397%\">負面之力</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2679%\">結合部分負面狀態主題護符的能力。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.5924%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_91381f24-d34b-44c3-9882-db458045d502.png\" alt=\"環境之力\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:21.1397%\">環境之力</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.2679%\">結合部分環境主題護符的能力。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:left;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#e0e0e0;background-color:#0d0d0d\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#fff\">\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;width:11.7197%\">&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;text-align:center;width:20.884%\">飾品</th>\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;text-align:center;width:67.3963%\">能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_ae3aa3a6-8fa1-4c54-a5ec-312b3eb61781.png\" alt=\"風神長靴\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">風神長靴</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">提升衝刺速度。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_ef7280ff-3cf7-4a39-b79e-39de0bbab9c8.png\" alt=\"琥珀蹄鐵氣球\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">琥珀蹄鐵氣球</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">摔落傷害上限為 2 顆心。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_5837f0ed-9e3e-41a7-9b2e-7451b96a0dfe.png\" alt=\"古代號角\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">古代號角</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">從超過 2 個方塊高度落下後，獲得短暫加速。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_b16cc3eb-1f20-4cc3-8cc2-bdb9140a8c52.png\" alt=\"安卡之盾\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">安卡之盾</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">提供對黑暗與中毒狀態的免疫。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_d56fda9a-7c1a-484b-b8be-ef8f06742558.png\" alt=\"蜜蜂披風\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">蜜蜂披風</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">蜜蜂永遠不會對你產生敵意。靠近蜂巢時，會緩慢恢復飽食度。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_c1bc2ebc-41a1-469d-a684-bdd8a514e130.png\" alt=\"祝福蘋果\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">祝福蘋果</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">衝刺時提供輔助跳躍。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_3e3d2232-7270-4abd-b71f-293fc5152b2f.png\" alt=\"困惑之腦\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">困惑之腦</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">有 10% 機率閃避攻擊。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_46f8ef1d-7e6e-4a1b-9b08-e3ed66f6789b.png\" alt=\"腦波干擾器\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">腦波干擾器</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">在敵人附近衝刺時，偶爾會使周圍敵人陷入混亂。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_734e6650-4185-454f-96a5-aecc39d2770c.png\" alt=\"蹄鐵氣球組\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">蹄鐵氣球組</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">抵消 10 個方塊以內的摔落傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_f76ff263-c825-4b08-9754-684e1113fbd3.png\" alt=\"神話護符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">神話護符</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">持續治療時提升生命值恢復速度。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_1721db83-8cce-445b-a483-3bfda4d3729a.png\" alt=\"飛行地毯\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">飛行地毯</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">下落時按住 [左Shift] 鍵可緩慢滑翔，降低下落速度並允許空中轉向。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_7d5f7d04-4948-4e56-8a65-a707bcf82539.png\" alt=\"寒冰之盾\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">寒冰之盾</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">提供對冰凍傷害的免疫，並在生命值低於一半時提供臨時抗性增益。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_7d09e6e1-05d6-4a55-a0d2-37a55fa299e2.png\" alt=\"暖手爐\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">暖手爐</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">提供對緩慢狀態的免疫。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_b87ba46a-1f42-4b92-aaaf-3c65785763f5.png\" alt=\"英雄之盾\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">英雄之盾</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">提供來自攻擊或爆炸的擊退抗性，並吸引附近怪物的仇恨。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_2a170a0e-b505-48c2-b5cb-d8c22eed8cbc.png\" alt=\"忍者大師套裝\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">忍者大師套裝</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">除非遭到攻擊，否則不會驚擾守衛者。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_e19d0edb-b333-4bc1-8dd1-48ed81ad98e1.png\" alt=\"機械礦車\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">機械礦車</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">讓你在軌道上疾馳，猶如礦車內裝有馬達！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_95eba717-1660-4967-a671-efeb7f240e0d.png\" alt=\"黑曜石蹄鐵\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">黑曜石蹄鐵</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">提供在熔岩方塊上行走而不受傷害的能力，並提供有限的熔岩抗性。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_fe8898ed-eef6-4684-b7f7-bc2c0dfda6e9.png\" alt=\"口袋鏡\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">口袋鏡</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">提供對失明與噁心狀態的免疫。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_b4c5b01b-dc7d-413f-8dcd-3c7e6d153158.png\" alt=\"馴鹿鈴鐺\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">馴鹿鈴鐺</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">提升跳躍高度。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_e5cbfd3e-3d6a-4c47-a54e-8f68904a7324.png\" alt=\"克蘇魯之盾\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">克蘇魯之盾</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">衝刺時與敵人碰撞會將其擊退。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_b7dfa4c4-540b-4ae3-a8ca-af731275a9e3.png\" alt=\"閃耀石\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">閃耀石</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">靜止不動 30 秒後開始恢復生命值。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_a27f0d68-c393-4ff2-a58e-3d20a12e8003.png\" alt=\"星光面紗\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">星光面紗</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">受到傷害後延長無敵時間。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_d4a1eb7e-82ef-4e49-8a90-b6a6779797ce.png\" alt=\"甜心項鍊\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">甜心項鍊</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">衝刺時為附近玩家提供生命恢復。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_997bc7d1-e9c1-4056-be04-bca1e4471bba.png\" alt=\"蠕蟲圍巾\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">蠕蟲圍巾</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">減少 2% 受到的傷害。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:left;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#e0e0e0;background-color:#0d0d0d\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#fff\">\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;width:11.7197%\">&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;text-align:center;width:20.884%\">靈魂</th>\n<th style=\"font-weight:bold;text-align:center;width:67.3963%\">能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_82f5cadd-20c7-4207-9056-be59672f5b23.gif\" alt=\"麥塊之魂\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">麥塊之魂</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">結合所有「力量」的能力。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_c98a0586-6b0f-443c-9f61-a1b50b21bca2.png\" alt=\"飛行大師之魂\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">飛行大師之魂</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">賦予創造模式飛行能力。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_46a8168f-ebed-415b-96f4-93577b7a4687.png\" alt=\"巨人之魂\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">巨人之魂</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">賦予超人般的防禦力、生命值，以及對所有負面狀態的免疫。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_f616bc36-47a9-4762-8d74-a6169416f4f6.png\" alt=\"超音速之魂\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">超音速之魂</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">賦予奔跑與飛行的超音速速度。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color:#262626\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:11.7197%\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_e3a16633-4a01-4966-8a15-cc03f6f614dc.webp\" alt=\"維度之魂\" width=\"24\" height=\"22\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:20.884%\">維度之魂</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.3963%\">結合所有「靈魂」的能力。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_eff3e970-f248-441f-b221-24eb568cb211.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">🏰 法哥的地牢：終極挑戰</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">在世界深處隱藏著法哥的地牢，一個充滿黑暗與危險的地方。只有最勇敢的冒險者敢於進入，但回報絕對值得冒險。面對獨特的怪物，收集稀有戰利品，並獲取強大的<strong>可憎能量</strong>來製作最傳奇的神器。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_48efce87-ae00-457b-b58b-3faeba69ab98.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_a058321e-70f4-4c82-b461-c892e2b20a51.png\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:40px\">🛠 合成配方</h3>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">每個護符都需要特定的基礎材料（普通、進階、史詩等）以及一些合成素材。部分靈魂所需的物品可以從法哥的地牢中掉落（擊殺敵人）或拾取（在寶箱中找到）。請密切留意<strong>可憎能量</strong>及其他獨特物品，以製作更強大的裝備。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_763c387e-113a-4f40-be0a-0ad44dbfc702.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">📝 遊戲內設定</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">遊戲內提供設定選項。若已安裝 Patchouli，可透過指南書中的快捷連結進入；或直接執行指令 <code>/fargostalismans talisman gui</code></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_f4459442-7e29-44c5-8680-01afb7d34bff.png\" alt=\"\"></h3>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:40px\">😄 常見問題</h3>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>問：</strong>我可以在整合包中使用這個模組嗎？<br><strong>答：</strong>當然可以！只需在適當的地方標明原作者即可。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>問：</strong>這個模組與其他模組相容嗎？<br><strong>答：</strong>是的，它與大多數其他模組都能良好協作，尤其是那些增強生存與探索體驗的模組。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>問：</strong>為什麼我的護符沒有作用？<br><strong>答：</strong>請確保它已在伺服器端和客戶端同時啟用。如果仍有問題，請嘗試關閉後重新開啟。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/950292/description_aed46048-8223-4b8c-a09c-2b4258ce5e54.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:40px\">🎉 特別感謝</h3>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">衷心感謝泰拉瑞亞模組開發者 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsteamcommunity.com%252fsharedfiles%252ffiledetails%252f%253fid%253d2815540735\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fargowilta</a> 以及藝術家 Donmor 和 sixtydegrees，本模組深受其啟發。</p>",
